msgid "Delete Saved Search Template(s)"
msgstr "刪除已儲存的搜尋範本"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Export Saved Search Template(s)"
msgstr "匯出已儲存的搜尋範本"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
#, php-format
msgid "NOTE: Imported %d and updated %d Saved Search Template(s)."
msgstr "注意：已匯入 %d 個並更新 %d 個已儲存搜尋範本。"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
#, php-format
msgid "ERROR: %d Saved Search Template(s) failed to import."
msgstr "錯誤：%d 個已儲存的搜尋範本匯入失敗。"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Import Saved Search Template from Local File"
msgstr "從本機檔案匯入已儲存的搜尋範本"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "If the JSON file containing the Saved Search Template definition data is located on your local machine, select it here."
msgstr "如果包含已儲存搜尋範本定義資料的 JSON 檔案位於您的本機電腦上，請在此處選取。"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Import Saved Search Template from Text"
msgstr "從文字匯入已儲存的搜尋範本"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "If you have the JSON file containing the Saved Search Template definition data as text, you can paste it into this box to import it."
msgstr "如果您有文字格式的已儲存搜尋範本定義資料 JSON 檔案內容，可將其貼到此方塊中進行匯入。"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Import Saved Search Template"
msgstr "匯入已儲存的搜尋範本"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Edit Saved Search Template"
msgstr "編輯已儲存的搜尋範本"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "The name shown to all users in Saved Searches."
msgstr "在「已儲存的搜尋」中顯示給所有使用者的名稱。"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "The account that owns this template and can manage it in Saved Searches."
msgstr "擁有此範本並可在已儲存的搜尋中管理它的帳號。"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Users who can use this template in addition to its owner. All Users shares it with everyone."
msgstr "除了擁有者之外，可使用此範本的使用者。「所有使用者」表示與所有人共用。"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Groups who can use this template in addition to its owner. All Groups shares it with everyone."
msgstr "除擁有者外可使用此範本的群組。「所有群組」會與所有人共用此範本。"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Search Query"
msgstr "搜尋查詢"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Correct the query syntax to use the query builder."
msgstr "請修正查詢語法以使用查詢建立器。"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Choose a field, operator, and value. Use AND, OR, NOT, or Group to build the query. Changes apply to this shared template for all users."
msgstr "選擇欄位、運算子與值。使用 AND、OR、NOT 或群組來建立查詢。變更將套用至所有使用者的此共用範本。"

